        "3998": {"synopsis":"Counts the free blocks in the drive's bitmap (blocks 0 up to (IX+$05)) and returns the free\nspace in KB. From the routine at $08FC (DOS_JUMPS $0121).\nEntry: IX = the drive's table.\nExit: carry set, HL = the free KB.\nChanges: AF, BC, DE, HL.","comment":"Free blocks so far"},
