        "4075": {"synopsis":"Finds the first free directory entry ($E5 in byte 0, FREE_ENTRY_TEST) for record BC's new\nentry, searching the whole directory, and clears bit 1 of the record's byte $22. The search\nlimit (IX+$24) is put back, or moved up to the entry found. If none is found the claimed\nentry is counted back and the error is $20.\nEntry: BC = the file record, IX = the drive's table.\nExit: carry set, DE = the entry number, HL = its copy at $DFA2; carry clear and A = the\nerror.\nChanges: AF, DE, HL."},
