        "4200": {"synopsis":"Returns the length of file B (DOS_JUMPS $0139): bytes $23-$25 of its file record, where\nreading stops and which writing past it moves on (LEN_EXTEND).\nEntry: B = the file number, 0-15.\nExit: carry set, E:HL = the length, D = 0, BC = the file record; carry clear and A = the\nerror ($15 bad number, $1D not open).\nChanges: AF, BC, DE, HL.","comment":"Is file B open?"},
