        "9653": {"comment":"Yes: error 7"},
        "9655": {"comment":"Carry clear"},
        "9657": {"synopsis":"Reads D x 256 + E bytes from port BC into HL with INI, restoring B for each byte (16 bytes a\npass for the whole 256s), then pages RAM bank 7 back in (SWAP_BANK).\nEntry: B, C = the port, DE = the count, HL = the destination.\nExit: HL past the bytes, DE = 0, A = the bank that was paged in.\nChanges: AF, DE, HL.","comment":"A = the port's high byte"},
        "9658": {"comment":"E = 0?"},
        "9659": {"comment":"(test E)"},
        "9660": {"comment":"Yes: whole 256s only"},
        "9662": {"synopsis":"The E bytes over a whole 256.","comment":"One byte"},
        "9664": {"comment":"Port high byte back"},
        "9665": {"comment":"E bytes"},
        "9666": {"comment":"Until E is 0"},
        "9668": {"comment":"Then D runs of 256"},
        "9669": {"comment":"Then the 256s"},
        "9671": {"synopsis":"256 bytes: 16 passes.","comment":"16 passes of 16 bytes"},
        "9673": {"synopsis":"16 bytes.","comment":"16 bytes, B put back each time"},
        "9721": {"comment":"Next pass"},
        "9722": {"comment":"16 passes?"},
        "9724": {"synopsis":"Next 256.","comment":"Next 256"},
        "9725": {"comment":"All the 256s?"},
        "9727": {"comment":"Bank 7 back"},
        "9729": {"comment":"Out through SWAP_BANK"},
        "9732": {"synopsis":"Writes 512-byte block C:DE of a hard disk partition (jump table at $00A0, entry $00AF; also\nfrom $313A and $3168): the 256-byte sectors 2 x block and 2 x block + 1 (HD_SECTOR_WRITE).\nEntry: IX = the partition record, C:DE = the block, B = the buffer's RAM bank, HL = the\nbuffer.\nExit: carry, HL past the 512 bytes; or carry clear and A = 0 (time-out), 1, 2 (outside the\npartition) or 7. With bit 7 of C set: A = 2 and NZ, carry not changed.\nChanges: AF, HL; RAM bank 7 is paged in at the end.","comment":"Block over 23 bits?"},
        "9734": {"comment":"Then error 2"},
        "9736": {"comment":"Bit 7 set: error 2"},
        "9737": {"comment":"Keep the block"},
        "9739": {"comment":"C:DE = 2 x the block"},
        "9741": {"comment":"(2 x C:DE)"},
        "9745": {"comment":"Write its first sector"},
        "9748": {"comment":"Failed?"},
        "9750": {"comment":"Then the second"},
        "9751": {"comment":"Write the second"},
        "9754": {"synopsis":"Registers back.","comment":"Registers back"},
        "9755": {"comment":"BC back"},
        "9757": {"synopsis":"Writes 256-byte sector C:DE of partition IX from HL in RAM bank B.\n1. The registers set up (HD_SECTOR_SETUP), $30 to port $FFEF.\n2. Waits until bits 7, 3 and 0 of port $FFEF read 0, 1, 0. On a time-out A = 0; otherwise A\n   = 1 when bit 6 of port $CFEF is set, else 7.\n3. 256 bytes from HL to port $CEEF, bank 7 back.\n4. Waits until bits 7, 3 and 0 all read 0; error 7 if bit 0 is then set.\nExit: carry, HL + 256; or carry clear and A = the error.","comment":"Registers for sector C:DE"},
        "9760": {"comment":"Failed?"},
        "9761": {"comment":"Command $30"},
        "9764": {"comment":"to port $FFEF"},
        "9767": {"comment":"Command sent"},
        "9770": {"comment":"Keep the buffer"},
        "9771": {"comment":"Wait: bit 7 clear, bit 3 set, bit 0 clear"},
        "9774": {"comment":"Wait for it to want data"},
        "9777": {"comment":"HL = the buffer"},
        "9778": {"comment":"Ready: send the data"},
        "9780": {"comment":"Time-out?"},
        "9782": {"comment":"Yes: A = 0"},
        "9784": {"comment":"Read port $CFEF"},
        "9787": {"comment":"Read port $CFEF"},
        "9790": {"comment":"Bit 6 set?"},
        "9792": {"comment":"No: error 7"},
        "9795": {"comment":"Yes: error 1"},
        "9798": {"synopsis":"The 256 bytes out with bank B paged in."},
        "9800": {"comment":"The buffer's bank in"},
