        "10046": {"synopsis":"ORs the unit select bits (IX+$10) into head A, then HD_SELECT_REG.","comment":"Add the unit select bits"},
        "10049": {"synopsis":"Writes A to port $FEEF and waits until bit 7 of port $FFEF is clear and bit 6 set\n(HD_WAIT_STATUS).\nExit: carry; or carry clear and A = 0 or 7.\nChanges: AF.","comment":"Keep BC and HL"},
