        "10207": {"synopsis":"Does nothing but set carry. The drive code at $33A5 and $33EA looks for this address in a\ndrive record.","comment":"Nothing to do: success"},
        "10209": {"synopsis":"Reads a record for a drive that lives on a hard disk partition; the code at $38AA looks for\nthis address in a drive record.\n1. DE = D x 128 + (E AND $7F), C = 0: the block.\n2. IX = the word at (IX+$17), the partition record, for HD_BLOCK_READ; IX back.\nEntry: IX = the drive record, D, E, B = the RAM bank, HL = the buffer.\nExit: as HD_BLOCK_READ.","comment":"DE = D x 128 + (E AND $7F)"},
        "10211": {"comment":"(D's bit 0 into carry)"},
