        "10683": {"synopsis":"8 bytes for a unit record until its system partition is read: 1 cylinder, 2 heads, 2 sectors\nper track, 4 per cylinder, entries up to 0."},
        "10691": {"synopsis":"The system partition's name: \"PLUSIDEDOS\" and six spaces."},
        "10707": {"synopsis":"Counts the partitions of unit A that are mapped in a partition record (DOS_JUMPS $01A5).\nEntry 0 (the system partition) is not counted.\nEntry: A = the unit (0 or 1).\nExit: carry; A = E = the count; HL = the last unused record of the four at $E897, or 0.\nChanges: AF, BC, DE, HL, IX.","comment":"C = the unit x 16"},
