        "11066": {"synopsis":"Finds where entry BC of unit A's partition table is.\nEntry: A = the unit, BC = the entry.\nExit: carry, IX = the system record, DE = the block (entry / 8), BC = the offset in it\n((entry AND 7) x 64); carry clear and A = $16 (no unit) or $38 (past the last entry).\nChanges: AF, BC, DE, HL, IX.","comment":"IX = the unit record"},
