        "11122": {"synopsis":"Copies the 64 bytes of entry BC of unit A's partition table to HL (jump table at $00A0,\nentry $00C4; and many callers). The block is read into $ED11 in bank 7.\nEntry: A = the unit, BC = the entry, HL = the destination.\nExit: carry; or carry clear and A = the error.\nChanges: AF, DE, HL; BC and IX kept.","comment":"Registers kept"},
