        "11990": {"synopsis":"Finds the cylinder and head of 256-byte sector 2 x block + 1, the end of block A:HL,\ncounting from cylinder 0 head 0.\nEntry: A:HL = the block, IX = the unit record.\nExit: DE = the cylinder, A = the head.\nChanges: F, DE, HL.","comment":"BC kept"},
