        "12188": {"synopsis":"Gives entry BC of unit A's partition table back to free space (jump table at $00A0, entry\n$00BE). Continues to $3074.\n1. The unit must be there (HD_UNIT_REC) and the entry not mapped (PART_NOT_MAPPED); it is\n   read into $EF11.\n2. Each free entry (type $FF) is read into $EF51: if it ends a head before this one starts,\n   it is stretched to this one's end; if it starts a head after this one ends, to this one's\n   start. It is resized and written, this entry cleared to zero, and the grown entry, now in\n   $EF11, is checked against the rest the same way.\n3. When no free entry touches it, this entry becomes type $FF, its name zero.\nExit: carry; or carry clear and A = the error.\nChanges: AF, BC, DE, HL; $EF11-$EF90.","comment":"IX kept"},
