        "15142": {"comment":"13 from the template"},
        "15145": {"comment":"The channel made"},
        "15148": {"comment":"HL at its +$0D"},
        "15153": {"comment":"The file number"},
        "15154": {"comment":"Carry: done"},
        "15156": {"synopsis":"The first 13 bytes of a channel F (a file), copied by CHAN_NEW: output and input both $5B00,\nthe letter F, the words $3EE0, $3E73 and $3E4E, and the length $000E. The file number\nfollows\nat +$0D."},
        "15169": {"synopsis":"M: a channel M over memory, from \"M>a,n\": a 19-byte channel from M_CHAN_TEMPL, with n at\n+$0D-$0E and a at +$11-$12. No \",n\", text left over or n = 0: nothing made, carry clear.","comment":"The first number"},
        "15172": {"comment":"Kept"},
        "15173": {"comment":"\",n\""},
        "15176": {"comment":"DE = the first number"},
        "15177": {"comment":"None?"},
