        "15213": {"comment":"Carry: done"},
        "15215": {"synopsis":"The first 13 bytes of a channel M (memory): output and input $5B00, the letter M, the words\n$031C, $0321 and $0326, and the length $0013."},
        "15228": {"synopsis":"V: a channel V over a string variable, from \"V>a$\" (one letter): a 16-byte channel from\nV_CHAN_TEMPL with the letter (bit 7 set) at +$0D. Other text: nothing made.","comment":"Over 255 characters?"},
        "15231": {"comment":"One at least?"},
